---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Handheld GameDB. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-invert prose-cyan max-w-none">

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: March 8, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        Handheld GameDB ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that data.
      </p>

      <!-- What Data We Collect -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What Data We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">We collect only the minimum data necessary to provide our service:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Account information:</strong> When you sign in via Google OAuth, we receive your email address, display name, and profile picture. We do not receive or store your Google password.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Steam ID:</strong> If you choose to link your Steam account or import your Steam library, we store your Steam ID to associate performance reports with verified game ownership.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Performance reports:</strong> When you submit a performance report, we store the device, game, settings configuration, FPS data, TDP settings, battery observations, and any notes you include.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Usage data:</strong> We collect anonymous, aggregated analytics data (page views, referrers) via Plausible Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not track individual users.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- How We Use Your Data -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">Your data is used to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Authenticate your account and manage your session</li>
          <li>Display your submitted reports and profile</li>
          <li>Aggregate performance data into consensus settings profiles</li>
          <li>Calculate contributor reputation scores</li>
          <li>Improve the database and user experience through anonymous analytics</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes. Ever.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Cookies -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We use <strong class="text-white">session cookies only</strong>. These are strictly necessary to keep you signed in and are deleted when you close your browser or sign out. We do not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or any third-party cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Third-Party Services -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">We rely on the following third-party services:</p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-900/50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Supabase</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-400">Database hosting and authentication. Your data is stored in Supabase's infrastructure with encryption at rest. <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 underline">Supabase Privacy Policy</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-900/50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Google OAuth</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-400">Authentication provider. We only access your basic profile information (email, name, avatar). <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 underline">Google Privacy Policy</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-800 bg-gray-900/50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Plausible Analytics</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-400">Privacy-focused, cookie-free web analytics. No personal data is collected. All data is aggregated and anonymous. <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 underline">Plausible Data Policy</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Data Retention -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Your account data is retained for as long as you maintain an active account. Performance reports are retained indefinitely as part of the public database, even if you delete your account, as they are contributed under a <strong class="text-white">CC-BY license</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          If you delete your account, your personal information (email, name, avatar, Steam ID) will be removed within 30 days. Your submitted reports will be anonymized but remain in the database.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Your Rights -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">You have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your account and personal data</li>
          <li>Export your data in a machine-readable format</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@handheldgamedb.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 underline">privacy@handheldgamedb.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          For privacy-related questions or concerns, email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@handheldgamedb.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 underline">privacy@handheldgamedb.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
